        "https://huggingface.co/datasets/andy279/nemotron-reasoning-challenge`"
      ]
    },
    "README.md": {
      "bytes": 4347,
      "contains_hf_token_pattern": false,
      "head_redacted": "---\nlicense: apache-2.0\ntask_categories:\n  - text-generation\nlanguage:\n  - en\ntags:\n  - reasoning\n  - math\n  - puzzles\n  - sft\n  - nemotron\nsize_categories:\n  - 10K<n<100K\ndataset_info:\n  - config_name: default\n    features:\n      - name: messages\n        list:\n          - name: role\n            dtype: string\n          - name: content\n            dtype: string\n    splits:\n      - name: train\n        num_examples: 49290\n      - name: validation\n        num_examples: 1165\nconfigs:\n  - config_name: default\n    data_files:\n      - split: train\n        path: sft_train.jsonl\n      - split: validation\n        path: sft_val.jsonl\n---\n\n# Nemotron Reasoning Challenge — SFT Data\n\nSupervised fine-tuning data for `nvidia/Nemotron-3-Nano-30B-A3B` on puzzles from the [NVIDIA Nemotron Reasoning Challenge](https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/nvidia-nemotron-reasoning-challenge) Kaggle competition.\n\n## Splits\n\n| Split | Examples | Unique puzzles | Description |\n|-------|----------|----------------|-------------|\n| `train` | 49,290 | 7,200 | Correct reasoning traces from teacher models + solvers |\n| `validation` | 1,165 | 1,123 | Held-out puzzles for evaluation (includes 399 unsolved transformation p",
